BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:43e778cb5318@nordiccrypto.no
DTSTAMP:20261110T161436Z
DTSTART:20261119T163000Z
SUMMARY:Bitcoin Suisse Europe launches in the Nordics
LOCATION:La Voûte\, Bank Hotel\, Arsenalsgatan 6\, 111 47 Stockholm\, Stoc
 kholm
URL:https://eu.welcometobetter.bitcoinsuisse.com/bitcoin-suisse-europe-laun
 ches-in-the-nordics
DESCRIPTION:Invitation only. Doors open 17:30 CET. Roman Przibylla and Domi
 nic Weibel on the market outlook\, and Pernilla van der Capellen (Aspia) o
 n Swedish tax treatment of digital assets\, then drinks in the vault. Atte
 ndance is by invitation from Bitcoin Suisse.\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/
 search/?api=1&query=La%20Vo%C3%BBte%2C%20Bank%20Hotel%2C%20Arsenalsgatan%2
 06%2C%20111%2047%20Stockholm
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6054d96c8b8f@nordiccrypto.no
DTSTAMP:20261110T161436Z
DTSTART:20261119T170000Z
DTEND:20261119T181500Z
SUMMARY:Exklusiv kväll med Bitwise
LOCATION:Sturegatan 15\, 113 89 Stockholm\, Stockholm
URL:https://medlem.ungaaktiesparare.se/event/exklusiv-kvall-med-bitwise/
DESCRIPTION:In Swedish. Limited places. Marco Poblete (Bitwise\, Nordic hea
 d) on bitcoin and the largest crypto assets: how they work\, the role they
  play in today's market\, and where he sees it going\, with questions from
  the floor.\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sturegatan%20
 15%2C%20113%2089%20Stockholm
END:VEVENT
